  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flood Reconstruction Programme - Transport Component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Overall Objective : The overall objectives of the Sudan Emergency Flood Reconstruction Programme were to bring the operating economic performance of the country to its pre-flood level through : (a) Restoration of the essential economic infrastructure ; (b) Alleviation of the suffering of the people in the flood affected areas ; and (c) Strengthening of the institutional framework of the FRP programme. 2. Specific Objectives : The  specific objectives of the transport sector programme financed by the ADF was to improve efficiency of the Sudan Railway Corporation.</narrative>
  </description>
